The directory /usr/gnu (bin, lib, man):

GNU binaries, including awk 2.11.1, bash 1.05.1, bison ??.??,
fileutils 1.4, compress, cpio, diff 1.15, grep & egrep, elvis 1.4,
emacs 18.57 (get the lisp files from the emacs distribution), find
2.0, gcc 1.39 with Bruce syntax, same with gas syntax, some GNU
binutils, make 3.59, makeinfo, patch, sed 1.06, tar 1.09, texindex.
The library files and manual pages for the above.

